g"},{"type":"html","id":"ggszcTytOYQ_srcSet_mobile_src","label":"ggszcTytOYQ_srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Regal_King_in_a_Golden_Palace_d0abc637-ff27-409e-8532-f035bbaba47d.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBk2pt--b7_text","label":"ggBk2pt--b7_text","default":"<p><strong>THE ANCIENT KING'S APHRODISIAC SECRET</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ancient cultures valued herbs associated with sexual desire, fertility, and masculine vitality.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Alpha Brew </strong>uses Black Maca, a Peruvian root traditionally consumed for energy and sexual wellness.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here's what makes it interesting: small human studies suggest Maca may help improve sexual desire without significantly increasing testosterone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>WHY IT MATTERS:</strong> Testosterone isn't the only factor influencing your sex drive. That's why Alpha Brew includes Black Maca alongside other botanicals traditionally associated with men's vitality.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggO5LpaV36L_text","label":"ggO5LpaV36L_text","default":"<p><strong>THE ANCIENT BLOOD-FLOW SECRET</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Testosterone is important for sexual health, but erections also depend on healthy blood flow.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your blood vessels must relax and allow blood to enter erectile tissue to produce firmness.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Traditional Chinese medicine used Horny Goat Weed in preparations associated with male sexual wellness.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Alpha Brew</strong> combines Horny Goat Weed with L-Citrulline, an amino acid involved in the body's nitric oxide pathway, which helps regulate blood-vessel relaxation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>WHY IT MATTERS:</strong> Blood flow is an important part of erectile function that testosterone boosters alone may not address.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAKukWiRaA_text","label":"ggAKukWiRaA_text","default":"<strong>2.STAY HARD WITHOUT CONSTANTLY THINKING ABOUT IT</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-ypSydqZb_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg-ypSydqZb_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Regal_King_in_a_Gilded_Chamber_c50f859a-9e84-4412-8daa-71a6d6c05354.png"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-ypSydqZb_srcSet_mobile_src","label":"gg-ypSydqZb_srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Regal_King_in_a_Gilded_Chamber_c50f859a-9e84-4412-8daa-71a6d6c05354.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXHrcwJVLN_text","label":"ggXHrcwJVLN_text","default":"<strong>3. ENJOY THE MOMENT WITHOUT FINISHING FAST</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGCvqHJYJv_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggGCvqHJYJv_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Regal_King_s_Golden_Coffee_Retreat_281e232a-9450-4830-b161-93b9379daa4b.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGCvqHJYJv_srcSet_mobile_src","label":"ggGCvqHJYJv_srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Regal_King_s_Golden_Coffee_Retreat_281e232a-9450-4830-b161-93b9379daa4b.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmhjQvCYG3_text","label":"ggmhjQvCYG3_text","default":"<p><strong>THE ROYAL COMPOSURE SECRET</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Being able to get hard and being able to control when you finish are two different things.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Stress, performance anxiety, and arousal patterns can influence sexual experiences.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For centuries, Ashwagandha has been used in Ayurvedic wellness traditions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Modern studies suggest certain Ashwagandha extracts may help reduce perceived stress. L-Theanine has also been studied for relaxation-related benefits.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Alpha Brew</strong> includes both ingredients.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>WHY IT MATTERS:</strong> Feeling calmer may make intimacy more enjoyable, although these ingredients haven't been proven to delay ejaculation.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggH0i-8S3kj_text","label":"ggH0i-8S3kj_text","default":"<p><strong>THE ANCIENT WARRIOR'S VITALITY SECRET</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ancient herbal traditions valued ingredients associated with strength, physical vitality, and endurance.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tongkat Ali has a history of traditional use in Southeast Asia, while Shilajit has long been used in Ayurvedic preparations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Alpha Brew</strong> combines these ingredients with Arabica coffee.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>WHY IT MATTERS:</strong> Energy isn't controlled by testosterone alone. Sleep, nutrition, physical health, and daily habits also influence how energetic you feel.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZIc3k0bpa_text","label":"ggZIc3k0bpa_text","default":"<strong>&nbsp;4. ENERGY THAT LASTS ALL DAY</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggp7THAOKbz_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggp7THAOKbz_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Mountain_King_at_Sunrise_aade0fea-06bf-4f0f-b4aa-9175a591e475.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggp7THAOKbz_srcSet_mobile_src","label":"ggp7THAOKbz_srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Mountain_King_at_Sunrise_aade0fea-06bf-4f0f-b4aa-9175a591e475.png"}],
